1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
देर से जवाब देना = गहरी सोच?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,400
नहीं। Response time अकेला पर्याप्त नहीं।

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,300
Deliberation एक theoretical construct है।

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,200
Response control और answer generation

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,100
Justification और regulation भी functions हैं।

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,900
एक test सब कुछ सीधे नहीं मापता।

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,700
Task behavior: choice और accuracy

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,300
Response time भी task measure है।

9
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,100
Stable thinking style का पूरा प्रमाण नहीं।

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,900
Confidence: reported judgment

11
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,600
Hidden thought का transcript नहीं।

12
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,500
Confidence और accuracy अलग measures हैं।

13
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,300
Computational models patterns describe करते हैं।

14
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,000
Evidence accumulation और conflict detection

15
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,800
Later analytic processing एक model term है।

16
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,800
Model parameter = assumptions के भीतर estimate

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,200
Literal mind scan नहीं।

18
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,000
Slow = better? Universal rule नहीं।

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,800
CRT study में संबंध कमजोर था।

20
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:56,000
Observe, sample, task और theory की सीमा देखें।

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,800
यह diagnosis नहीं है और personal, medical, या financial advice नहीं है। AI narration और conceptual visuals उपयोग हुए हैं।
